    "text": "My Ref. No.: 4-3/15/2018/VE/50. Divisional Secretary\u2019s Ref. No.: ARA/LND/ACQVI/D3/51. By virtue of the powers vested in me by Proviso (a) to Section 38 of the Land Acquisition Act, (Chapter 460), I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation, do hereby direct the Acquiring O\ufb03 cer or any other o\ufb03 cer authorized by him referred to in Paragraph I of the schedule to take immediate possession of the land speci\ufb01 ed in the corresponding entry in Paragraph II of that Schedule.",
